      "rationale": "Ezreal is a pro-play staple (47% presence) while underperforming in solo queue (47.9% global / 48.4% KR WR). His pro value comes from late-game, coordinated siege and poke, with Trueshot Barrage as a global siege/teamfight tool at the center of it. We're reducing R base damage at ranks 2 and 3 (550/750 -> 500/650) while leaving rank 1 untouched. This trims his late siege and teamfight contribution (sim: pro_index -1.9%, late DPS and siege score down ~2%) without touching his laning or early/mid power (soloq_index unchanged), so solo queue players don't get hit on a champion who's already below 50%."
